gta-toolkit's own comment on them: "This file contains only SHA1 hashes of all
interesting values. There is NO key."


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What is NOT derived from a third party
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The format work in this repository - the RSC7 container, the ydr / ydd / yft / ytd /
ytyp / ymap / META readers and writers, the shader-parameter layout, the archive
walker and the precedence model - was reverse engineered from files produced by a
genuine game installation and from publicly documented RAGE format knowledge.

QUARRY is not affiliated with, derived from, or endorsed by the reference exporter. Where this
codebase describes an XML shape as interoperable with other community tooling, that
is a statement about file compatibility for users, not a statement of lineage.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Rockstar Games material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

QUARRY contains no Rockstar Games assets and no Rockstar Games code.

`resources/magic.dat` is Rockstar-derived key material. It is NOT in this
repository and is not distributed through it. It is not licensed to us and we make
no claim to license it onward. It is inert without a 32-byte key that exists only
inside a genuine installed copy of the game.

QUARRY reads only the files on the operating user's own machine, from that user's
own game installation. It ships no game data, and it is not a means of obtaining
the game or any part of it.

